.TH SYNORA-WEB 1 "June 2026" "Synora Studio 1.0" "Synora Web SaaS Commands"
.SH NAME
synora-web \- Synora Studio Headless Web SaaS Portal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python web.py
[\-\-host \fIHOST\fR] [\-\-port \fIPORT\fR] [\-\-db-driver \fIDRIVER\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B synora-web
is the front-facing SaaS web portal for Synora Studio. It handles user authentication, tenant provisioning, LLM usage accounting, and routes authenticated payloads securely into the backend AI server.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-host \fIHOST\fR
Bind the web application to the specified host. (Default: 0.0.0.0)
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIPORT\fR
Bind the web application to the specified port. (Default: 8888)
.TP
.B \-\-db-driver \fIDRIVER\fR
Override the tenant database driver. Options: \fBturso\fR, \fBpostgres\fR, \fBmysql\fR.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start the web portal on port 80:
.B python web.py --port 80
.SH AUTHOR
Synora Studio Framework
